---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const rewardCode = 'Survey2026_FreeWeek';
---

<Layout
  title="Headzone Feedback Survey - Art is the Game"
  description="Share your feedback about Headzone and receive a free week of Headzone Pro."
  currentPage=""
  lang="en-US"
>
  <div class="feedback-page">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="hero fade-in">
        <span class="eyebrow">Headzone feedback survey</span>
        <h1>Help shape Headzone</h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">
          I&apos;m building Headzone to help athletes sharpen focus under pressure, recover faster after mistakes,
          and carry better mental performance into the real world. This short survey helps me understand what is
          working, what is missing, and what would make the app more valuable for you.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-meta">
          <span>Estimated time: 4-6 minutes</span>
          <span>Reward: 1 free week of Headzone Pro</span>
        </div>
      </header>

      <section class="intro-card slide-up">
        <h2>Before you start</h2>
        <p>
          The survey is mobile-first and works directly inside Headzone&apos;s in-app browser. Once you submit, your
          thank-you screen will show the offer code you can redeem from the app&apos;s subscription screen or Awards area.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="feedbackSuccess" class="success-panel is-hidden" aria-live="polite" tabindex="-1">
        <div class="success-copy">
          <span class="success-kicker">Thank you</span>
          <h2>Thanks for helping shape Headzone</h2>
          <p>
            As promised, here is your free week of Headzone Pro. You can redeem your code from the Headzone paywall
            or Awards area by tapping <strong>Redeem Free Week Code</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="reward-card">
          <div>
            <p class="reward-label">Your reward</p>
            <h3>1 free week of Headzone Pro</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="reward-code-block">
            <span class="reward-code-label">Redemption code</span>
            <code>{rewardCode}</code>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="redeem-steps">
          <h3>How to redeem</h3>
          <ol>
            <li>Open Headzone.</li>
            <li>Go to the upgrade or subscription screen.</li>
            <li>Tap <strong>Redeem Free Week Code</strong>.</li>
            <li>Enter the code shown above.</li>
          </ol>
          <p class="redeem-note">
            If the code does not apply right away, make sure you are signed into the App Store account you use for
            Headzone subscriptions.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="form-shell slide-up">
        <div class="form-shell-header">
          <div>
            <p class="section-label">Survey</p>
            <h2>Tell me what&apos;s working and what&apos;s missing</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="privacy-note">
            Your responses are sent through the same secure FormSubmit flow already used on artisthegame.com and land
            in your support inbox.
          </p>
        </div>

        <p id="feedbackFormStatus" class="form-status is-hidden" role="alert"></p>

        <form
          id="feedbackForm"
          class="feedback-form"
          action="https://formsubmit.co/ajax/pfarnam@icloud.com"
          method="POST"
        >
          <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Headzone Feedback Survey" />
          <input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="false" />
          <input type="hidden" name="_template" value="table" />
          <input type="hidden" name="submission_source" value="headzone-feedback-survey" />
          <input type="hidden" name="submission_origin" value="artisthegame.com/feedback" />
          <input type="text" name="_honey" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />

          <section class="survey-section">
            <div class="section-header">
              <span class="section-number">01</span>
              <div>
                <h3>About you</h3>
                <p>A little context helps me understand your answers.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <fieldset class="question-card">
              <legend>1. What best describes you? <span class="required">*</span></legend>
              <div class="choices-grid">
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q01_role" value="Competitive athlete" required /> <span>Competitive athlete</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q01_role" value="Recreational athlete" /> <span>Recreational athlete</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q01_role" value="Coach or trainer" /> <span>Coach or trainer</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q01_role" value="Parent of an athlete" /> <span>Parent of an athlete</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q01_role" value="Student" /> <span>Student</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q01_role" value="Working professional" /> <span>Working professional</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q01_role" value="Other" data-other-target="q01RoleOther" /> <span>Other</span></label>
              </div>
              <div id="q01RoleOther" class="other-input" data-other-wrapper hidden>
                <label for="q01RoleOtherText">Tell me a little more</label>
                <input id="q01RoleOtherText" type="text" name="q01_role_other" placeholder="Your role" data-required-when-visible="true" disabled />
              </div>
            </fieldset>

            <fieldset class="question-card">
              <legend>2. Which sport or performance area matters most to you right now? <span class="required">*</span></legend>
              <label class="question-label" for="q02PrimaryFocus">Your answer</label>
              <input id="q02PrimaryFocus" type="text" name="q02_primary_focus" placeholder="Sport, position, or performance area" required />
            </fieldset>

            <fieldset class="question-card">
              <legend>3. What level are you currently competing or performing at? <span class="required">*</span></legend>
              <div class="choices-grid">
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q03_level" value="Youth / junior" required /> <span>Youth / junior</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q03_level" value="High school" /> <span>High school</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q03_level" value="College / university" /> <span>College / university</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q03_level" value="Amateur adult" /> <span>Amateur adult</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q03_level" value="Semi-pro" /> <span>Semi-pro</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q03_level" value="Professional" /> <span>Professional</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q03_level" value="Not sport-specific" /> <span>Not sport-specific</span></label>
              </div>
            </fieldset>
          </section>

          <section class="survey-section">
            <div class="section-header">
              <span class="section-number">02</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Why you tried Headzone</h3>
                <p>I want to know what promise mattered most when you first opened the app.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <fieldset class="question-card" data-required-checkbox-group>
              <legend>4. What made you download Headzone? <span class="required">*</span></legend>
              <p class="helper-text">Select all that apply.</p>
              <div class="choices-grid">
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q04_download_reasons" value="Improve focus" /> <span>Improve focus</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q04_download_reasons" value="Improve reaction speed" /> <span>Improve reaction speed</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q04_download_reasons" value="Improve decision-making" /> <span>Improve decision-making</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q04_download_reasons" value="Reduce mistakes under pressure" /> <span>Reduce mistakes under pressure</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q04_download_reasons" value="Build consistency" /> <span>Build consistency</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q04_download_reasons" value="Prepare for competition" /> <span>Prepare for competition</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q04_download_reasons" value="Curiosity" /> <span>Curiosity</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q04_download_reasons" value="Recommendation from someone else" /> <span>Recommendation from someone else</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q04_download_reasons" value="Other" data-other-target="q04OtherReason" /> <span>Other</span></label>
              </div>
              <p class="group-error" hidden>Please choose at least one reason.</p>
              <div id="q04OtherReason" class="other-input" data-other-wrapper hidden>
                <label for="q04OtherReasonText">What else led you to try it?</label>
                <input id="q04OtherReasonText" type="text" name="q04_download_reasons_other" placeholder="Your answer" data-required-when-visible="true" disabled />
              </div>
            </fieldset>

            <fieldset class="question-card">
              <legend>5. What were you hoping Headzone would help you improve first? <span class="required">*</span></legend>
              <div class="choices-grid">
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q05_first_improvement" value="Recognition speed" required /> <span>Recognition speed</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q05_first_improvement" value="Precision / accuracy" /> <span>Precision / accuracy</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q05_first_improvement" value="Composure under pressure" /> <span>Composure under pressure</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q05_first_improvement" value="Reset after mistakes" /> <span>Reset after mistakes</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q05_first_improvement" value="Endurance / staying sharp longer" /> <span>Endurance / staying sharp longer</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q05_first_improvement" value="General focus" /> <span>General focus</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q05_first_improvement" value="Other" data-other-target="q05OtherImprovement" /> <span>Other</span></label>
              </div>
              <div id="q05OtherImprovement" class="other-input" data-other-wrapper hidden>
                <label for="q05OtherImprovementText">What were you hoping to improve?</label>
                <input id="q05OtherImprovementText" type="text" name="q05_first_improvement_other" placeholder="Your answer" data-required-when-visible="true" disabled />
              </div>
            </fieldset>

            <fieldset class="question-card">
              <legend>6. Before using Headzone, how clear was the benefit of the app to you? <span class="required">*</span></legend>
              <p class="helper-text">1 = Not clear at all, 5 = Extremely clear</p>
              <div class="scale-grid">
                <label class="scale-pill"><input type="radio" name="q06_benefit_clarity" value="1" required /> <span>1</span></label>
                <label class="scale-pill"><input type="radio" name="q06_benefit_clarity" value="2" /> <span>2</span></label>
                <label class="scale-pill"><input type="radio" name="q06_benefit_clarity" value="3" /> <span>3</span></label>
                <label class="scale-pill"><input type="radio" name="q06_benefit_clarity" value="4" /> <span>4</span></label>
                <label class="scale-pill"><input type="radio" name="q06_benefit_clarity" value="5" /> <span>5</span></label>
              </div>
            </fieldset>
          </section>

          <section class="survey-section">
            <div class="section-header">
              <span class="section-number">03</span>
              <div>
                <h3>First-use experience</h3>
                <p>This helps identify the roughest parts of the early user journey.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <fieldset class="question-card">
              <legend>7. How easy was it to get started? <span class="required">*</span></legend>
              <p class="helper-text">1 = Very confusing, 5 = Very easy</p>
              <div class="scale-grid">
                <label class="scale-pill"><input type="radio" name="q07_getting_started" value="1" required /> <span>1</span></label>
                <label class="scale-pill"><input type="radio" name="q07_getting_started" value="2" /> <span>2</span></label>
                <label class="scale-pill"><input type="radio" name="q07_getting_started" value="3" /> <span>3</span></label>
                <label class="scale-pill"><input type="radio" name="q07_getting_started" value="4" /> <span>4</span></label>
                <label class="scale-pill"><input type="radio" name="q07_getting_started" value="5" /> <span>5</span></label>
              </div>
            </fieldset>

            <fieldset class="question-card">
              <legend>8. Which part of the first-use experience felt weakest? <span class="required">*</span></legend>
              <div class="choices-grid">
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q08_weakest_first_use" value="Onboarding" required /> <span>Onboarding</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q08_weakest_first_use" value="Choosing a mode" /> <span>Choosing a mode</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q08_weakest_first_use" value="Understanding the training goal" /> <span>Understanding the training goal</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q08_weakest_first_use" value="Audio / settings" /> <span>Audio / settings</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q08_weakest_first_use" value="Paywall / subscription messaging" /> <span>Paywall / subscription messaging</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q08_weakest_first_use" value="Results / coaching explanation" /> <span>Results / coaching explanation</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q08_weakest_first_use" value="Nothing felt weak" /> <span>Nothing felt weak</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q08_weakest_first_use" value="Other" data-other-target="q08WeakestOther" /> <span>Other</span></label>
              </div>
              <div id="q08WeakestOther" class="other-input" data-other-wrapper hidden>
                <label for="q08WeakestOtherText">What felt weakest?</label>
                <input id="q08WeakestOtherText" type="text" name="q08_weakest_first_use_other" placeholder="Your answer" data-required-when-visible="true" disabled />
              </div>
            </fieldset>

            <fieldset class="question-card">
              <legend>9. If anything confused you early on, what was it?</legend>
              <label class="question-label" for="q09EarlyConfusion">Optional details</label>
              <textarea id="q09EarlyConfusion" name="q09_early_confusion" rows="4" placeholder="Anything you remember from the first session or two"></textarea>
            </fieldset>
          </section>

          <section class="survey-section">
            <div class="section-header">
              <span class="section-number">04</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Training experience</h3>
                <p>I&apos;m especially interested in how the drills map to real-world performance.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <fieldset class="question-card">
              <legend>10. How often have you used Headzone so far? <span class="required">*</span></legend>
              <div class="choices-grid">
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q10_usage_frequency" value="Just once" required /> <span>Just once</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q10_usage_frequency" value="2-3 sessions" /> <span>2-3 sessions</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q10_usage_frequency" value="4-10 sessions" /> <span>4-10 sessions</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q10_usage_frequency" value="11-25 sessions" /> <span>11-25 sessions</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q10_usage_frequency" value="25+ sessions" /> <span>25+ sessions</span></label>
              </div>
            </fieldset>

            <fieldset class="question-card" data-required-checkbox-group>
              <legend>11. Which training modes have felt most useful? <span class="required">*</span></legend>
              <p class="helper-text">Select all that apply.</p>
              <div class="choices-grid">
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q11_useful_modes" value="Modern" /> <span>Modern</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q11_useful_modes" value="Classic" /> <span>Classic</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q11_useful_modes" value="Recall" /> <span>Recall</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q11_useful_modes" value="Letter" /> <span>Letter</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q11_useful_modes" value="Moving Target" /> <span>Moving Target</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q11_useful_modes" value="Unique Figure" /> <span>Unique Figure</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q11_useful_modes" value="Squares" /> <span>Squares</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q11_useful_modes" value="Larger Number" /> <span>Larger Number</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q11_useful_modes" value="Position Shuffle" /> <span>Position Shuffle</span></label>
              </div>
              <p class="group-error" hidden>Please choose at least one training mode.</p>
            </fieldset>

            <fieldset class="question-card">
              <legend>12. Which training modes felt least useful or least clear?</legend>
              <label class="question-label" for="q12LeastUsefulModes">Optional details</label>
              <textarea id="q12LeastUsefulModes" name="q12_least_useful_modes" rows="4" placeholder="Tell me which ones missed the mark and why"></textarea>
            </fieldset>

            <fieldset class="question-card">
              <legend>13. How well do the training sessions feel connected to real-world performance? <span class="required">*</span></legend>
              <p class="helper-text">1 = Feels abstract / disconnected, 5 = Feels directly useful</p>
              <div class="scale-grid">
                <label class="scale-pill"><input type="radio" name="q13_real_world_connection" value="1" required /> <span>1</span></label>
                <label class="scale-pill"><input type="radio" name="q13_real_world_connection" value="2" /> <span>2</span></label>
                <label class="scale-pill"><input type="radio" name="q13_real_world_connection" value="3" /> <span>3</span></label>
                <label class="scale-pill"><input type="radio" name="q13_real_world_connection" value="4" /> <span>4</span></label>
                <label class="scale-pill"><input type="radio" name="q13_real_world_connection" value="5" /> <span>5</span></label>
              </div>
            </fieldset>

            <fieldset class="question-card">
              <legend>14. Have you noticed any real-world benefit yet?</legend>
              <p class="helper-text">If yes, where did you notice it? If not yet, what would need to happen for the app to feel more valuable?</p>
              <label class="question-label" for="q14RealWorldBenefit">Optional details</label>
              <textarea id="q14RealWorldBenefit" name="q14_real_world_benefit" rows="4" placeholder="Your answer"></textarea>
            </fieldset>
          </section>

          <section class="survey-section">
            <div class="section-header">
              <span class="section-number">05</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Coaching and results</h3>
                <p>This section is about the post-session feedback and coaching screens.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <fieldset class="question-card">
              <legend>15. How useful is the post-session coaching? <span class="required">*</span></legend>
              <p class="helper-text">1 = Not useful, 5 = Extremely useful</p>
              <div class="scale-grid">
                <label class="scale-pill"><input type="radio" name="q15_post_session_coaching" value="1" required /> <span>1</span></label>
                <label class="scale-pill"><input type="radio" name="q15_post_session_coaching" value="2" /> <span>2</span></label>
                <label class="scale-pill"><input type="radio" name="q15_post_session_coaching" value="3" /> <span>3</span></label>
                <label class="scale-pill"><input type="radio" name="q15_post_session_coaching" value="4" /> <span>4</span></label>
                <label class="scale-pill"><input type="radio" name="q15_post_session_coaching" value="5" /> <span>5</span></label>
              </div>
            </fieldset>

            <fieldset class="question-card">
              <legend>16. What kind of coaching do you want more of?</legend>
              <p class="helper-text">Select all that apply.</p>
              <div class="choices-grid">
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q16_more_coaching" value="Clear explanation of what happened" /> <span>Clear explanation of what happened</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q16_more_coaching" value="More specific next-step advice" /> <span>More specific next-step advice</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q16_more_coaching" value="Stronger real-world performance language" /> <span>Stronger real-world performance language</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q16_more_coaching" value="Better encouragement / motivation" /> <span>Better encouragement / motivation</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q16_more_coaching" value="Better workout recommendations" /> <span>Better workout recommendations</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q16_more_coaching" value="More visual explanation of mistakes or timing" /> <span>More visual explanation of mistakes or timing</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q16_more_coaching" value="Less text, more concise summaries" /> <span>Less text, more concise summaries</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q16_more_coaching" value="Other" data-other-target="q16OtherCoaching" /> <span>Other</span></label>
              </div>
              <div id="q16OtherCoaching" class="other-input" data-other-wrapper hidden>
                <label for="q16OtherCoachingText">What kind of coaching do you want more of?</label>
                <input id="q16OtherCoachingText" type="text" name="q16_more_coaching_other" placeholder="Your answer" data-required-when-visible="true" disabled />
              </div>
            </fieldset>

            <fieldset class="question-card">
              <legend>17. If you could improve one thing about the results or coaching screen, what would it be?</legend>
              <label class="question-label" for="q17ImproveResults">Optional details</label>
              <textarea id="q17ImproveResults" name="q17_results_screen_improvement" rows="4" placeholder="Your answer"></textarea>
            </fieldset>
          </section>

          <section class="survey-section">
            <div class="section-header">
              <span class="section-number">06</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Subscription and value</h3>
                <p>I want to understand where the current value proposition feels strong or weak.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <fieldset class="question-card">
              <legend>18. Which statement best matches you? <span class="required">*</span></legend>
              <div class="choices-grid">
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q18_subscription_status" value="already-subscribe" required /> <span>I already subscribe to Headzone Pro</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q18_subscription_status" value="free-trial" /> <span>I am currently in the free trial</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q18_subscription_status" value="interested-not-ready" /> <span>I am interested, but not ready yet</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q18_subscription_status" value="not-enough-value" /> <span>I do not currently see enough value to subscribe</span></label>
                <label class="choice-pill"><input type="radio" name="q18_subscription_status" value="did-not-understand-pro" /> <span>I did not understand what Pro would unlock</span></label>
              </div>
            </fieldset>

            <div id="subscriptionFollowup" class="conditional-section" hidden>
              <fieldset class="question-card">
                <legend>19. What would make Headzone Pro feel worth paying for?</legend>
                <p class="helper-text">Select all that apply.</p>
                <div class="choices-grid">
                  <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q19_pro_value" value="Better coaching insights" disabled /> <span>Better coaching insights</span></label>
                  <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q19_pro_value" value="Stronger personalized workouts" disabled /> <span>Stronger personalized workouts</span></label>
                  <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q19_pro_value" value="More training modes" disabled /> <span>More training modes</span></label>
                  <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q19_pro_value" value="Better progress tracking" disabled /> <span>Better progress tracking</span></label>
                  <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q19_pro_value" value="Better Game Center / leaderboard features" disabled /> <span>Better Game Center / leaderboard features</span></label>
                  <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q19_pro_value" value="Better sound / music customization" disabled /> <span>Better sound / music customization</span></label>
                  <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q19_pro_value" value="More obvious real-world performance benefit" disabled /> <span>More obvious real-world performance benefit</span></label>
                  <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q19_pro_value" value="Lower price" disabled /> <span>Lower price</span></label>
                  <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q19_pro_value" value="More generous trial / offer" disabled /> <span>More generous trial / offer</span></label>
                  <label class="choice-pill"><input type="checkbox" name="q19_pro_value" value="Other" data-other-target="q19OtherValue" disabled /> <span>Other</span></label>
                </div>
                <div id="q19OtherValue" class="other-input" data-other-wrapper hidden>
                  <label for="q19OtherValueText">What would make it feel worth paying for?</label>
                  <input id="q19OtherValueText" type="text" name="q19_pro_value_other" placeholder="Your answer" data-required-when-visible="true" disabled />
                </div>
              </fieldset>

              <fieldset class="question-card">
                <legend>20. If you decided not to subscribe today, what held you back most?</legend>
                <label class="question-label" for="q20HoldBack">Optional details</label>
                <textarea id="q20HoldBack" name="q20_hold_back" rows="4" placeholder="Your answer" disabled></textarea>
              </fieldset>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="survey-section">
            <div class="section-header">
              <span class="section-number">07</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Closing</h3>
                <p>The final two questions help prioritize what I should build next.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <fieldset class="question-card">
              <legend>21. What is the one thing you most want me to improve next in Headzone? <span class="required">*</span></legend>
              <label class="question-label" for="q21ImproveNext">Your answer</label>
              <textarea id="q21ImproveNext" name="q21_improve_next" rows="4" placeholder="The one change you would most want next" required></textarea>
            </fieldset>

            <fieldset class="question-card">
              <legend>22. If you want, leave your email so I can follow up about your feedback or invite you to test improvements.</legend>
              <p class="helper-text">Optional.</p>
              <label class="question-label" for="q22Email">Email address</label>
              <input id="q22Email" type="email" name="email" inputmode="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="name@example.com" />
            </fieldset>
          </section>

          <div class="submit-row">
            <p class="submit-note">
              After you submit, your free-week code will appear immediately on this page.
            </p>
            <button id="feedbackSubmitBtn" type="submit" class="submit-btn">Send survey and show my code</button>
          </div>
        </form>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

